SUMMARY: Bleeding Edge Presents: Canadian premiere of LOCKJAW
DESCRIPTION:On May 13th\, Bleeding Edge invites you to the Canadian premi
 ere of Sabrina Greco’s Lockjaw\, a darkly comic look at life with your mo
 uth wired shut! It plays at Paradise Theatre for ONE NIGHT ONLY! Tickets 
 available HERE! https://paradiseonbloor.com/movies/lockjaw/\n\nWriter/Dir
 ector Sabrina Greco and Editor/Cinematographer Neal Wynne will be in atte
 ndance for a live Q&A!\n\nSix weeks after getting into a drunk driving ac
 cident that leaves her jaw wired shut\, Rayna (Blu Hunt) tries to have a 
 fun night out with her friends.\n\nA hilarious comedy of manners\, the fi
 lm over an efficient 77-minute runtime breaks down the complicated social
  dynamics that compromise modern living. Containing a highly memorable en
 semble cast of characters\, you’ll find yourself not wanting to leave the
 ir orbit\, no matter how much they make your skin crawl.
CATEGORIES:Film,Paradise-Theatre
