 nto an eerie coral reef nestled at the deepest point of the Mariana Trenc
 h. This Albino Reef gives explorers a fantastical glimpse into the sensor
 y explosive environment that has technically passed on but continues to y
 ield stories of brewing magic.\n\nPlease read the nights' structure on th
 e site linked below and choose your own adventure accordingly to your cur
 iosity tastes.\n\nWe are excited to bring you this adaptation of the Merm
 aid Ball Costume Party. Costumes continue to be strongly encouraged as th
 ey add so much to the immersive experience with your participation. Thank
  you for your support!\n\nEnjoy more pix + vids of past parties here: MER
 MAIDBALL.CA https://mermaidball.ca
