SUMMARY: WTF: Work Time Fun - a Comedy X Storytelling show
DESCRIPTION:Listen to This! WTF: Work Time Fun\n\nListen to This! is a un
 ique storytelling comedy show in downtown Toronto featuring some of the c
 ity's most talented storytellers and comedians telling funny stories arou
 nd a different theme.\n\nCan comedians adapt to having to tell a single c
 ontinuous story without relying on their bits and crowd work? Can storyte
 llers focus on the funny and integrate jokes into their tale? That's the 
 challenge we put to them and the results are always incredible.\n\nThis m
 onth's theme is WTF: Work Time Fun: 8 hilarious stories about working\, w
 ork environments\, and strange encounters on the job.\n\nThursday\, May 2
 8th\, 2026. Doors at 8PM.\n\nFree Times Cafe (320 College St\, Toronto)\n
 \nLine-up and more information at: https://www.nowlistentothis.ca/ https:
 //www.nowlistentothis.ca/\n\nTickets at: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/wtf-
