SUMMARY: The Ultimate Throwback Party
DESCRIPTION:Step into a night of pure nostalgia with The Ultimate Throwba
 ck Party \, an epic live music party experience! Powered by the electrify
 ing sounds of Sly Fox\, this high-energy 10-piece band brings your favori
 te hits from the ’80s\, ’90s\, and 2000s back to life on stage.\n\nFrom W
 hitney Houston and Tina Turner to Prince and Bon Jovi\, every iconic anth
 em and dancefloor classic will move you. Whether you’re reliving your glo
 ry days or just love a packed dance floor\, this is your chance to sing a
 long\, let loose\, and dance the night away.\n\nVocals - Will Bowes\nVoca
 ls - Claire Davis\nVocals - Joanna Mohammad\nDrums - Pat Daniher\nBass - 
 Dan Minchom\nGuitar - William Gooch\nKeys - Gio Campanelli\nSax - Carrie 
 Chesnutt\nTrombone - Josh Bird\nTrumpet - Julian Bridley
