SUMMARY: Gelli plate printmaking Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Curious about Gelli printing? Come play with paint and discov
 er how fun (and addictive) this process can be. In this beginner-friendly
  workshop\, you’ll experiment with color\, texture\, and layering to crea
 te one-of-a-kind prints—no experience needed. It’s relaxed\, hands-on\, a
 nd all about exploring. You’ll leave with a stack of original prints and 
 the confidence to keep going at home.
CATEGORIES:printmaking,gelliprint,artworkshops,gelliart
