SUMMARY: World Club of Giving - Hosted by Dwayne De Rosario
DESCRIPTION:A one-night-only World Cup nightlife experience hosted by Can
 adian soccer legend and FIFA Ambassador Dwayne De Rosario\, with a specia
 l live set by internationally recognized DJ Sickick.\n\nOn June 25th\, Wo
 rld Club of Giving hosts a premium World Cup watch party and nightlife ex
 perience at the iconic FYE Ultra Club Toronto. Bringing together global f
 ootball passion\, celebrity appearances\, live entertainment\, and philan
 thropy for an unforgettable evening.\n\nGuests can expect:\n\n  * A high-
 energy World Cup-inspired atmosphere\n  * Celebrity athletes\, entertaine
 rs\, and VIP guests\n  * Premium nightlife experience at one of Toronto’s
  top venues\n  * Live DJ performances and entertainment\n  * Food\, cockt
 ails\, and bottle service\n  * VIP booths and private hospitality experie
 nces\n  * Exclusive meet & greet opportunities\n  * A chance to connect w
 ith leaders\, influencers\, and football fans from around the world\n\nAl
 l proceeds support Soccer for Cancer - a Canadian Cancer Society initiati
 ve\, helping unite communities through the power of sport while supportin
 g Canadians affected by cancer.\n\nVisit: worldclubofgiving.com http://wo
 rldclubofgiving.com/
