SUMMARY: Toronto Film School’s Summer Acting Academy for Teens!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Film School’s Summer Acting Academy for Teens!\n\n  *
  June 29 to July 3 (no class on July 1) from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.\n  * $650\n
 \nIn this immersive TFS Summer Academy https://•%09https:/www.torontofilm
 school.ca/academy/acting-academy \, participants work with Toronto Film S
 chool instructors to explore the craft of acting in a supportive\, hands-
 on environment. You’ll develop foundational skills including character wo
 rk\, script analysis\, blocking\, stagecraft\, and camera awareness while
  learning how to be authentic and truthful in a role.\n\nGuided by experi
 enced industry professionals\, you’ll prepare scenes for both live perfor
 mance and industry-standard self-tapes\, building confidence\, control\, 
 and expressive range. This week-long Acting Academy offers an introductor
 y look at the same practical\, industry-focused training delivered in Tor
 onto Film School’s full-time Acting for Film\, TV and Theatre Diploma Pro
 gram https://www.torontofilmschool.ca/programs/acting/ .\n\n***Applicants
  must be entering Grade 11 or 12 and be 17 or younger at the academy’s en
 d.
