SUMMARY: Kaya Fest Toronto 2026
DESCRIPTION:Stephen Marley and The Marley Family Present Kaya Fest Toront
 o 2026\n\n\nHistoric Music Festival Debuts in Toronto at Markham Fairgrou
 nds on Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\n\nFeaturing The Marley Family - Steph
 en\, Damian\, Julian & Ky-Mani Marley\, Shabba Ranks\, Lila Iké\, Jesse R
 oyal & Many More!\nAlso performing: Marley 3rd Generation with YG Marley\
 , Yohan Marley\, Mystic Marley\, DJ Shacia Päyne & More\n\nKaya Fest is a
  global music and awareness festival founded by Stephen Marley—9x Grammy 
 Award winner\, singer\, songwriter\, producer\, and son of the legendary 
 Bob Marley. Rooted in the guiding principle of “Education Before Recreati
 on\,” Kaya Fest brings together music\, culture\, and community to celebr
 ate unity\, peace\, and conscious living.\n\nA multigenerational\, family
 -run experience\, Kaya Fest has become known for curating world-class lin
 eups of reggae and genre-crossing artists. Past performers have included 
 icons such as Ms. Lauryn Hill\, Snoop Dogg\, Cypress Hill\, Pitbull\, Sea
 n Paul\, Chronixx\, and Wyclef Jean.\n\nFollowing a celebrated run of sol
 d-out festivals and standout cultural moments\, Kaya Fest continues to ex
 pand its global footprint—bringing together exceptional performances\, im
 pactful storytelling\, and unique opportunities for community and brand e
 ngagement.\n\n\nEvent Details:\n\nKaya Fest Toronto 2026\nSaturday\, Augu
 st 22\, 2026\n2:00 PM – 11:00 PM\n\nMarkham Fairgrounds\n10801 McCowan Rd
 \nMarkham\, ON\n\nGeneral Admission & VIP Packages On Sale Now!\n\nFor fe
 stival information\, tickets\, artist updates\, and schedule details\, vi
 sit:\nwww.kayafest.live https://www.kayafest.live/?utm_source=chatgpt.com
 \n\n
CATEGORIES:Festival,Concert
